      "text": "How I test any new AI tool in 10 minutes:\n\n1. Give it my real work, not a demo prompt\n2. Try to make it fail on purpose\n3. Check what happens to my data\n4. Ask: would I pay double?\n\nIf step 4 is no, it's a toy. Toys are fine. Just don't build workflows on them.",
